  "title": "Supplementary Table S25. Exploratory held-out prognostic analysis of a separate score.",
  "panel": "",
  "panel_title": "",
  "notes_before": [],
  "notes_after": [
    "Note. Participants were assigned to training and held-out partitions in a two-thirds/one-third split. The table reports participant-wave observation counts and event-positive test observations, not unique participants or deaths. The separate score and its evaluation frame are distinct from the supplied BAA used in the primary environmental models; this exercise is exploratory and does not define or validate the primary outcome. Abbreviations: BAA, biological age acceleration; CI, confidence interval; HR, hazard ratio."
